  <data name="DescriptionFileStoreChanged" xml:space="preserve">
    <value>如果您希望保留现有的报告, 则必须手动将其复制到新的
重新启动本地服务之前的位置。否则, 应重新启动本地服务
并立即重新编制索引。</value>
    <comment>If you wish to keep your existing studies, you must manually copy them to the new
location before restarting the local service. Otherwise, you should restart the local service
and immediately re-index.</comment>
  </data>
  <data name="DescriptionPriorsServers" xml:space="preserve">
    <value>请检查应自动搜索的服务器, 以获取先前的检查。</value>
    <comment>Please check the servers that should be automatically searched for prior studies.</comment>
  </data>
  <data name="DescriptionStorageOptions" xml:space="preserve">
    <value>除非停止本地服务, 否则无法更改文件存储位置。文件存储发生更改后, 必须在重新启动本地服务之前手动将文件从旧位置复制, 或者只需重新启动本地服务并立即重新编制索引。

如果超过最大磁盘使用量, 工作站将拒绝导入映像或通过网络接收映像, 以避免耗尽磁盘。如果使用的空间达到最大值, 建议您增加最大使用率、删除某些检查或将文件存储移动到容量更大的磁盘。</value>
    <comment>The file store location cannot be changed unless the local service is stopped. Once the file store has changed, you must either manually copy files over from the old location before restarting the local service, or simply restart the local service and immediately re-index.

If the maximum disk usage is exceeded, the Workstation will refuse to import images or receive them over the network in order to avoid exhausting the disk. If the used space is reaching the maximum, it is recommended you increase the maximum usage, delete some studies, or move the file store to a disk with more capacity.</comment>
  </data>
